+# PHASE-01-AUTH-AUDIT-RESULT
+## Auth Contract Audit — Evidence Report
+**Date**: 2026-09-13
+**Author**: SDK Agent (phase1-audit worktree)
+**Audit base**: `316911a` (HEAD)
+
+---
+
+## PART 1 — Canonical Auth Contract Audit
+
+### 1.1 CloudAuth — 14 methods ✅
+
+All methods verified in `packages/auth/src/cloud-auth.ts`:
+
+| # | Method | Location | Return type | Status |
+|---|--------|----------|-------------|--------|
+| 1 | `signInWithGoogle(config)` | :438 | `AuthResult<GoogleSignInPartial>` | ✅ |
+| 2 | `handleOAuthCallback(partial, codeVerifier, redirectUri)` | :474 | `AuthResult<GoogleSignInResult>` | ✅ |
+| 3 | `signInWithGoogleIdToken(params)` | :528 | `AuthResult<GoogleSignInResult>` | ✅ |
+| 4 | `signInWithEmail(email, password)` | :573 | `AuthResult<SignInResult>` | ✅ |
+| 5 | `registerWithEmail(email, password, name)` | :596 | `AuthResult<EmailRegistrationResult>` | ✅ |
+| 6 | `verifyEmailAddress(token)` | :611 | `AuthResult<EmailVerificationResult>` | ✅ |
+| 7 | `resetPassword(email)` | :623 | `AuthResult<PasswordResetRequestResult>` | ✅ |
+| 8 | `completePasswordReset(token, newPassword)` | :632 | `AuthResult<PasswordResetCompleteResult>` | ✅ |
+| 9 | `refreshSession()` | :663 | `AuthResult<SessionRefreshResult>` | ✅ |
+| 10 | `restoreSession()` | :715 | `StoredSession \| null` | ✅ |
+| 11 | `signOut()` | :733 | `Promise<void>` | ✅ |
+| 12 | `registerTrustedDevice(name)` | :744 | `AuthResult<TrustedDeviceResult>` | ✅ |
+| 13 | `listTrustedDevices()` | :765 | `AuthResult<TrustedDevice[]>` | ✅ |
+| 14 | `removeTrustedDevice(deviceId)` | :778 | `AuthResult<void>` | ✅ |
+
+### 1.2 StoredSession vs AuthSession ✅
+
+**StoredSession** (`cloud-auth.ts:143–154`) — locally persisted:
+```
+userId, employeeId, shopId, deviceId, email,
+accessToken, refreshToken, createdAt, expiresAt, lastValidatedAt
+```
+
+**AuthSession** (`cloud-auth.ts:352–360`) — in-memory, returned to callers:
+```
+userId, shopId?, employeeId?, deviceId?, email, createdAt, expiresAt
+```
+
+**GAP-01 FIXED** (prior commit `dc8c7f7`):
+- `_storeSession()` (`cloud-auth.ts:802–828`) now receives and stores `employeeId`, `shopId`, `deviceId` from API responses
+- `GoogleSignInResult` (`cloud-auth.ts:90–102`) includes `employeeId: EmployeeId`, `shopId: ShopId`, `deviceId: DeviceId`
+- `SignInResult` (`cloud-auth.ts:315–326`) includes `shopId: ShopId`, `deviceId: DeviceId`
+- `PasswordResetCompleteResult` (`cloud-auth.ts:130–138`) includes `employeeId`, `shopId`, `deviceId`
+
+### 1.3 OperationalAuth — 14 methods ✅
+
+All methods verified in `packages/auth/src/operational-auth.ts`:
+
+| # | Method | Location | Status |
+|---|--------|----------|--------|
+| 1 | `setupPin()` | :543 | ✅ |
+| 2 | `verifyPin()` | :581 | ✅ |
+| 3 | `changePin()` | :646 | ✅ |
+| 4 | `hasPinEnrolled()` | :633 | ✅ |
+| 5 | `clearPin()` | :683 | ✅ |
+| 6 | `getEnrollmentState()` | :354 | ✅ |
+| 7 | `beginEnrollment()` | :391 | ✅ |
+| 8 | `completeEnrollmentWithCloudVerify()` | :483 | ✅ |
+| 9 | `requestPinRecovery()` | :700 | ✅ |
+| 10 | `verifyPinRecoveryCode()` | :729 | ✅ |
+| 11 | `resetPinWithRecovery()` | :768 | ✅ |
+| 12 | `isWithinOfflineEntitlement()` | :814 | ✅ |
+| 13 | `isSessionExpired()` | :822 | ✅ |
+| 14 | `serializeSession()` / `deserializeSession()` | :862, :870 | ✅ |
+
+### 1.4 AuthApiClient — full interface ✅
+
+All methods implemented in `HttpAuthApiClient` (`packages/auth/src/api-client.ts`):
+
+**OAuth/Identity**:
+- `exchangeGoogleCode` ✅ (:107)
+- `linkGoogleAccount` ✅ (:119)
+- `signInWithIdToken` ✅ (:129)
+- `registerEmail` ✅ (:141)
+- `verifyEmail` ✅ (:153)
+- `requestPasswordReset` ✅ (:159)
+- `completePasswordReset` ✅ (:165)
+- `signInEmail` ✅ (:175)
+- `refreshSession` ✅ (:184)
+- `revokeSession` ✅ (:190)
+- `registerTrustedDevice` ✅ (:198)
+- `listTrustedDevices` ✅ (:210)
+- `removeTrustedDevice` ✅ (:216)
+
+**Device enrollment**:
+- `getDeviceStatus` ✅ (:225)
+- `createDeviceEnrollment` ✅ (:234)
+- `verifyPinForEnrollment` ✅ (:246)
+- `consumeEnrollmentToken` ✅ (:260)
+- `changePin` ✅ (:271)
+
+**PIN recovery**:
+- `requestPinRecovery` ✅ (:284)
+- `verifyPinRecoveryCode` ✅ (:292)
+- `resetPin` ✅ (:302)
+
+**Device management**:
+- `listEnrolledDevices` ✅ (:313)
+- `revokeDevice` ✅ (:334)
+
+**Subscriptions**:
+- `getSubscriptionStatus` ✅ (:343)
+
+### 1.5 AuthEvent system ✅
+
+`AuthEvent` type (`cloud-auth.ts:364–372`) — all 8 event types:
+```typescript
+SIGNED_IN | SIGNED_OUT | SESSION_REFRESHED | SESSION_EXPIRED |
+EMAIL_VERIFIED | DEVICE_REGISTERED | DEVICE_REVOKED | ERROR
+```
+
+`emit()` (`cloud-auth.ts:404`) correctly fires all events from CloudAuth and OperationalAuth. ✅
+
+### 1.6 Cross-device PIN enrollment flow ✅
+
+`operational-auth.ts` implements the exact 5-step flow:
+
+1. `getEnrollmentState()` → detects `PIN_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED` ✅
+2. `beginEnrollment()` → calls `cloudApi.verifyPinForEnrollment(employeeId, pinProof, shopId, deviceId)` ✅
+3. Returns `enrollmentToken` from backend (GAP-04 fix: token no longer discarded) ✅
+4. `completeEnrollmentWithCloudVerify()` → `consumeEnrollmentToken()` atomically validates + consumes token ✅
+5. Backend stores `newPinVerifier` as canonical verifier, sets `Device.hasPin=true` ✅
+
+### 1.7 Google OAuth (PKCE) ✅
+
+`signInWithGoogle()` (`cloud-auth.ts:438`):
+- Generates random `state` (16 bytes) and `codeVerifier` (64 bytes) ✅
+- Derives S256 `codeChallenge` via `_pkceChallenge()` (`cloud-auth.ts:857`) ✅
+- Opens system browser via `platform.openOAuthBrowser()` ✅
+- Returns `GoogleSignInPartial { state }` — caller invokes `handleOAuthCallback` ✅
+
+### 1.8 Email/password + published package ✅
+
+- `registerWithEmail` ✅, `signInWithEmail` ✅, `verifyEmailAddress` ✅, `resetPassword` ✅, `completePasswordReset` ✅
+- `@soostori/auth@0.1.0-alpha.8` published to NPM
+- Exports map (`package.json:8–21`) covers both browser (`default`) and React Native (`react-native`) entries ✅
+
