+ *   - product.*  — catalog mutations
+ *   - customer.* — customer mutations
+ *   - debt.*     — credit account events
+ *   - device.*   — device identity & lifecycle
+ *   - sync.*     — synchronization events
+ *   - subscription.* — billing lifecycle
